Upstream notice (retained as required by the MIT License above)

Portions of this project are derived from rawaccel
<https://github.com/RawAccelOfficial/rawaccel>, which is distributed under the
MIT License. The derived parts are:

  - RaCore/Wire.cs     - the driver IOCTL protocol and the binary layout of the
                         structs the driver memcpy's across the IOCTL boundary.
  - RaCore/Accel.cs    - the acceleration curve math, a port of the C++ headers
                         that compile into rawaccel.sys.
  - RaCore/Model/DriverDoc.cs - the range checks, ported from
                         rawaccel-validate.hpp.

The upstream copyright notice and the permission notice reproduced above apply
to those portions unchanged.
